{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1916bf26c7f6a68858b00af294d8cde3e82dfe04ae2013202d6aa7b515ce3169","ja":"志保、歌織、未来の3人は、劇場公演に向けて\nリハーサルを行なっていて……","zh":"志保、歌织、未来等3人正在为剧场公演进行排练……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ac30512d9901833169affb88ca78f3c366c8937e13a1a9374705c603d495759f","ja":"うん、だいぶ良くなったわね♪\n今日は、そろそろおしまいにしましょうか？","zh":"嗯，已经好多了呢♪\n今天差不多该结束了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bda0cab534674acabd9193b261b92ac2c5bf1ef1488a799c052344fb4fd81548","ja":"私はもう少し、自主レッスンしていきます。","zh":"我再自主练习一会儿。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"808549472fe22c956b8e558d1fde84ec0273e44e9f4af7a40039d638c83028b6","ja":"大きなお仕事が終わったタイミングだからこそ、\n気持ちを切り替えて、ちゃんと仕上げたいので。","zh":"正因为刚完成一项大工作，才更想转换心情，好好完成它。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5022eec5e06e996a58021e99d9909216a8dc58b440a3e15965c1b60266dd252a","ja":"じゃあ、私もレッスン続ける！\nもっと練習したら、もっとも～っと良くなるもんねっ！","zh":"那我也继续训练！\n多练习的话，就能变得更～更好了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"bae795ce571a47678a21df14e283e4346dc7406ddeae11c8e7c4d3cbdd82b681","ja":"そうね。それじゃあ私も、\nあともうちょっとだけ……。","zh":"是啊。那么我也再稍微……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ec380374580fd41d4858d2da6b22f2c785a3f2ce7e18b39b056118fe2cf017f4","ja":"未来はこの前、体調を崩したばかりでしょ。\nまだ、無理しないほうがいいわ。","zh":"未来前阵子才刚身体不适吧。\n你还是不要勉强自己比较好。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d60c86cb3015fac3523d908b0735e57a1dda52531be4bb9ab5f18e6a22caf90e","ja":"歌織さんも、この後、別のお仕事がありましたよね。\n私はひとりで大丈夫ですから。お疲れ様です。","zh":"歌织小姐之后也还有别的工作吧。\n我一个人没关系的。辛苦了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a9ecd053b7c948f42618e41535a6aede30670e378f16b196ab70e33f09f58a9e","ja":"う～ん。\n私は、本当にもう大丈夫なんだけどな～……。","zh":"嗯——  \n我真的已经没事了啦……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"481607b272289b13c7c6f44ff04fa5d79e5c95d73fbd884729fd54e81baec772","ja":"私たちのことを気にかけてくれたのね。\n志保ちゃん、優しいから。","zh":"你一直都有在关心我们呢。\n因为志保很温柔。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"af5e10e68bdc6585b982c636c48332cf1e56689f675d24e2678ab6539fac24c1","ja":"でも私も、頑張ってる志保のために\n何かしたいです！　できること、ないかな～？","zh":"不过，我也想为努力着的志保做点什么！有没有什么是我能做的呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1783.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"15f871e9f1a703a319e087a28f69ad8aa51e48b5474c88626a5e3f41fb3c38ce","ja":"そうね……あ、それなら！","zh":"是啊……啊，那样的话！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
